description:
Doresc să conectez aplicația de contabilitate SAGA cu platforma Smsapi.ro astfel încât să pot trimite direct din SAGA mesaje SMS de notificare către clienți. Am nevoie de:

• un modul sau script care se instalează fără a afecta funcționarea actuală a programului;  
• maparea câmpurilor relevante (număr telefon, nume client, text notificare) și posibilitatea de a personaliza mesajele;  
• gestionarea cheii API și a setărilor de autentificare în mod securizat;  
• jurnal de erori și confirmări de trimitere vizibil în SAGA;  
• documentație scurtă pentru instalare, configurare și actualizare.

Integrarea trebuie să folosească endpoint-urile oficiale Smsapi.ro și să respecte rate-limit-ul lor. Prefer soluție în .NET, dar sunt deschis la alternative dacă argumentați clar beneficiile.

B2B Sales Agent / Long-Term Business Partner — IT & Software Development

We are a team of strong engineers specializing in Backend, Frontend, Data Engineering, AI, and DevOps.

We are currently preparing for the next stage of our development — moving into a more serious B2B market and taking on larger and more complex projects.

And this is exactly when we want to find someone who can grow into this next stage with us.

We are not looking for a sales freelancer who simply brings in individual clients. We are looking for a B2B Sales Agent / Business Development Partner who can first work with us on several real projects, see how we work together, build an effective process with the team, and then continue growing with us on a long-term basis.

Your Role

* Identify and approach potential B2B clients;
* Reach decision-makers and establish initial contact;
* Understand business needs and identify potential opportunities;
* Present our technical capabilities and possible solutions;
* Lead commercial communication and negotiations;
* Work closely with our engineering team when shaping a solution for the client;
* Build and maintain long-term client relationships.

From the technical side, our team handles architecture, technical assessment, specialist selection, and project delivery.

Who We Are Looking For

We are looking for an independent B2B sales professional who understands how to work with businesses, identify commercial opportunities, and build meaningful client relations
